      "en": "The princes of Moab rose up, and they went to Balak, and said, “Balaam refuses to come with us.”",
      "ko": "모압 귀족들이 일어나 발락에게로 가서 고하되 발람이 우리와 함께 오기를 거절하더이다",
      "source_text_hash": "57378457bdfe63fff527c259d91e0e3d4d2daa22a8b61a90a46172e5e79d9cc9",
      "translation_text_hash": "3c443c8a6ec661767e00db98c8653d17719ba76ae20f5d0fb747891055d171fe",
