        "verse": 22
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "God’s anger burned because he went; and the LORD’s angel placed himself in the way as an adversary against him. Now he was riding on his donkey, and his two servants were with him.",
      "ko": "그가 행함을 인하여 하나님이 진노하심으로 여호와의 사자가 그를 막으려고 길에 서니라 발람은 자기 나귀를 타고 그 두 종은 그와 함께 있더니",
      "source_text_hash": "ed5c6ca28b70e0e43ddddb0dfd78fd9b307ca326dd3b5a936ae66d8c2ae5515f",
      "translation_text_hash": "435744e17bdf93a78a74cf64bdcd30b2bcc6f572a296dee9068fcb10b2810c7f",
