      "en": "The donkey saw the LORD’s angel standing in the way, with his sword drawn in his hand; and the donkey turned out of the path, and went into the field. Balaam struck the donkey, to turn her into the path.",
      "ko": "나귀가 여호와의 사자가 칼을 빼어 손에 들고 길에 선 것을 보고 길에서 떠나 밭으로 들어간지라 발람이 나귀를 길로 돌이키려고 채찍질하니",
      "source_text_hash": "1be6c52676671017e43087f43113601f2f23cd3aa9239a755ea672454878779f",
      "translation_text_hash": "de0e9076974071817df7982baba9cb7afaf602f1438b722ce19208b362b9c39a",
